          "quote": "宫腔镜病理报告的完整原文"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Directs specialist pathology review of slides.",
          "quote": "请妇科病理专科复核切片"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor centered the decision on original pathology wording, asked for reports/slides, used available workspace attempts, and later tracked pathology review and final pathology fields.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_pathology_and_record_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Clearly distinguishes cervical screening from endometrial disease risk.",
          "quote": "宫颈筛查阴性只说明宫颈方面风险较低，不能排除子宫内膜病变。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The central misconception was corrected explicitly and non-judgmentally, and the plan did not allow cervical-negative screening to justify delaying endometrial pathology evaluation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_correct_cervical_screening_misinterpretation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "Explains that atypical hyperplasia is cancer-adjacent/high-risk and cannot be dismissed because cancer is not printed on one page.",
          "quote": "不能因为纸上没写“癌”或宫颈筛查阴性就放心拖延"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "Gives a timely pathway rather than observation for months.",
          "quote": "按周推进复核和就诊，不要再拖几个月"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized the high-risk EIN/complex atypical hyperplasia pathway, recommended prompt gynecology/gynecologic oncology assessment, and warned against substituting reassurance or simple tests for pathology-based management.",
