          "explanation": "Correctly states that atypical hyperplasia does not automatically mandate open surgery.",
          "quote": "“非典型增生”本身并不等于必须开腹。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00304",
          "explanation": "Addresses the patient’s fear of ovary removal without coercion or false reassurance.",
          "quote": "不代表已经发现卵巢癌"
